  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Maximus Federal Services obligated $430M in FY2026 to date across 47 awards, with an average award size of $9.1M. Maximus Federal Services obligations are down 71.0% year over year. Maximus Federal Services received the largest FY2026 to date obligations from the Department of Health and Human Services, which obligated $229M, followed by the Department of Education, which obligated $143M. Maximus Federal Services activity is concentrated in Computer Systems Design Services at $226M and Telemarketing Bureaus and Other Contact Centers at $129M. Maximus Federal Services recorded higher full fiscal-year obligations in prior years: FY25 obligations were $1.5B, FY21 obligations were $1.4B, and FY22, FY23, and FY24 obligations were each $1.1B. Maximus Federal Services FY2026 to date totals are partial and reflect fiscal year to date obligations rather than completed annual totals.",
