      },
      {
        "heading": "Which agencies and markets account for most of Maximus Federal Services obligations?",
        "body": "The Department of Health and Human Services obligated $229M and the Department of Education obligated $143M in FY2026 to date. The top NAICS markets for Maximus Federal Services are Computer Systems Design Services at $226M and Telemarketing Bureaus and Other Contact Centers at $129M. Other notable agency obligations include the Department of the Treasury at $42.2M and the Department of Energy at $26.3M."
